    "intro_narrative": "You jolt awake on a metallic floor, the harsh hum of cooling fans and flickering ultraviolet lights assaulting your senses. You are trapped in Sub-Level 4, a clandestine cryptography lab previously operated by a rogue intelligence agency. The massive steel blast door sealing the exit is unyielding, and a grim digital countdown on the wall displays exactly sixty minutes until the facility initiates a complete thermobaric purge.\n\nYour only hope of survival lies in outsmarting the automated security matrix that now governs the lab. The facility's ultimate override sequence is hidden within an encrypted drive, safely locked away inside a heavily fortified biometric vault. To reach it, you must reactivate a sprawling network of dormant calculation modules, synthesizers, and cryptographic authenticators scattered around the room.\n\nEvery terminal and processor is connected in a complex web of data flow. You will need to carefully trace the outputs of one machine to the inputs of another, decrypting layers of security protocols as you go. Investigate the environment, restore the operational chains, and piece together the digital fragments. Find the master key and disable the lockdown before the timer reaches zero.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
